Well, I can reproduce your problem, and I can't find any simple fix.

But why do you want a full page structure inside of one tab item?  If you just want the slider to sit next to the first graph then you can accomplish this with standard dashboard layout tools.

Also, why do you make this full page a function of var when only the author of the app can set the value of var?

I suggest that you redesign your layout, rather than looking for a way to increase the height of the current structure.

