If you want to convert e.g. "2016-01-08 12:00:01" to "12:00:01", then you need to do:

strftime(strptime("2010-01-02 10:20:30", "%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S"), "%H:%M:%S")

You want to convert from string to date/time, then from date/time back to string.

