eventReactive is right, you're just missing a comma after input$action.

You should definitely verify that input$id is actually a number, e.g. use as.numeric(input$id) instead; or else you risk SQL injection <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SQL_injection>. Anything in the "input" object should be considered potentially hostile user input!

