Hi There,

I have shiny working nicely with some plotly plots, where the user chooses a plot type via a drop-down and a lovely plotly plot is created. However, though most of my plots use plotly and work perfectly, there is one which uses wordcloud.R which doesn't work.

My ui.R (below) is using plotlyOutput, so I can understand why any other plot types won't work. My non-plotly plots work perfectly if using plotOutput.

Is there a way I might be able to mix plotly and non-plotly type plots?

thanks.

ui.R

library(shiny)
library(plotly)

shinyUI(fluidPage(
  titlePanel("Help Library Analysis"),
  sidebarPanel(
    selectInput("plot_type", "Plot Type:",
