If the file is on disk, try reactiveFileReader. If it's in a database, try reactivePoll. These are assuming you control the server and get the data up there. If you're talking about hosting on ShinyApps.io, then you can't do the reactiveFileReader approach; there's no way to update a ShinyApps.io app without redeploying it.

